  "summary": "Decorative knotting technique creating symbolic patterns from continuous strands of cord or thread.",
  "description": "Chinese knotting features intricate, symmetrical patterns created from a single continuous strand of cord without cutting or pasting, often incorporating auspicious symbols and motifs. These knots developed from practical uses in clothing and daily life to become decorative art forms symbolizing good fortune, harmony, and longevity, with different patterns carrying specific cultural meanings.",
